{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":492168,"name":"Liyo","username":"Liyo_K","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/liyo_k/{size}/120997_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-15T22:47:29.393Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492168-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492168-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492168-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492168-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrogbot can’t reach the computer. I tried to recover it and I got a “Recover failed” popup after waiting for a while. Then I tried to reset the computer from the settings and got a “Reset failed” popup as well. I just paid for grok and it’s a fresh installation. I’ve not used it before.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf possible, can you reset the entire Grogbot computer from the back end?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492168-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492168-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNot sure, I’m a fresh user with a brand new account and installation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492168-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492168-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI suppose it’s supposed to be able to connect to the computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492168-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492168-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003c