XyN09ifOD4nxQuvOc7ZN\" width=\"259\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/d/6d2efb8eb34f95b0e364f21a225d3b888ebdcf73_2_259x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/d/6d2efb8eb34f95b0e364f21a225d3b888ebdcf73_2_388x750.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/d/6d2efb8eb34f95b0e364f21a225d3b888ebdcf73_2_518x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1D1D1D\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-16 040957.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e717×1379 72.5 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492168-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492168-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492168-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492168-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.52.0 - Windows\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot 1.10.0 - Android\u003cbr\u003e\nPaid yesterday, never got a working computer, no bots\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492168-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492168-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNever used anything\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492168-additional-information-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492168-additional-information-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRecover stuck at Reconnecting 75%\u003cbr\u003e\nReset: “The reset couldn’t finish. Grok Bot’s computer may be in a partial state”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-492168-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-492168-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T22:47:41.417Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":9,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":46.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171796,"topic_slug":"cant-reach-your-computer-reset-fails-new-user","display_username":"Liyo","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137987,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/cant-reach-your-computer-reset-fails-new-user/171796/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true,"can_vote":false},{"id":492284,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-16T04:42:14.284Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. Here’s the good news right away: on our side, everything looks fine with your account and computer. Every Recover and Reset actually completed on the backend. Only the last step fails, where the Windows app connects to the actual Grok Bot computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s happening: the app can reach our servers, but your network’s DNS can’t resolve the address the app uses to connect to the Grok Bot computer (it lives at \u003ccode\u003ecursorvm.com\u003c/code\u003e). This lookup happens on your side, so reinstalling, Reset, Recover, or a reset from our side won’t change anything. A rebuilt computer will get an address in the same zone. Please stop clicking Recover or Reset for now, each click just rebuilds the computer again without helping.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTry this on Windows:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully close Grok Bot: right-click the system tray icon (near the clock) and click Quit.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWindows Settings \u0026gt; Network \u0026amp; internet \u0026gt; select your connection (Wi-Fi or Ethernet).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNext to DNS server assignment, click Edit \u0026gt; Manual \u0026gt; turn on IPv4 \u0026gt; Preferred DNS: \u003ccode\u003e1.1.1.1\u003c/code\u003e, Alternate DNS: \u003ccode\u003e8.8.8.8\u003c/code\u003e \u0026gt; Save.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen PowerShell and run: \u003ccode\u003eipconfig /flushdns\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLaunch Grok Bot again and give it a couple of minutes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor Android on the same network: Settings \u0026gt; Network \u0026amp; internet \u0026gt; Private DNS \u0026gt; Private DNS provider hostname \u0026gt; enter \u003ccode\u003edns.google\u003c/code\u003e \u0026gt; Save, then reopen Grok Bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick way to confirm it’s DNS: try running Grok Bot on a different network, like mobile data from another carrier or a different Wi-Fi. If it connects there, then the issue is your current network’s DNS.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know how it goes after step 5. If it still won’t connect, tell me and we’ll dig deeper.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-16T04:42:14.284Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":21.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":171796,"topic_slug":"cant-reach-your-computer-reset-fails-new-user","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/cant-reach-your-computer-reset-fails-new-user/171796/5","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":true,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":492429,"name":"Liyo","username":"Liyo_K","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/liyo_k/{size}/120997_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-16T08:01:53.665Z","cooked":"\u003caside class=\"quote group-CursorStaff\" data-username=\"deanrie\" data-display-name=\"Dean Rie\" data-post=\"5\" data-topic=\"171796\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea3.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/48/1263_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e Dean Rie:\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003col start=\"4\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eipconfig /flushdns\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks Dean! You’re the best! That worked! \u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/fluentui/clinking_beer_mugs.png?v=15\" title=\":clinking_beer_mugs:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":clinking_beer_mugs:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-16T08:01:53.665Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":5,"quote_count":1,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":45.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171796,"topic_slug":"cant-reach-your-computer-reset-fails-new-user","display_username":"Liyo","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137987,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/cant-reach-your-computer-reset-fails-new-user/171796/6","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true}],"stream":[492168,492284,492429]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,2]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Can\u0026rsquo;t reach your computer, Reset fails - New user","id":171796,"title":"Can't reach your computer, Reset 