Computer \nRecovery failed \nGrok Bot could not reach the computer, so Grok Bot might not be able to work. \nsome error like t\u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":true,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"thumbnails":[{"max_width":null,"max_height":null,"width":2110,"height":1568,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/8/6/86da67d9d76165d7012b06b28dc618224545cf78.jpeg"},{"max_width":1024,"max_height":1024,"width":1024,"height":760,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/8/6/86da67d9d76165d7012b06b28dc618224545cf78_2_1024x760.jpeg"},{"max_width":1000,"max_height":1000,"width":1000,"height":743,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/8/6/86da67d9d76165d7012b06b28dc618224545cf78_2_1000x743.jpeg"},{"max_width":800,"max_height":800,"width":800,"height":594,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/8/6/86da67d9d76165d7012b06b28dc618224545cf78_2_800x594.jpeg"},{"max_width":750,"max_height":750,"width":750,"height":557,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/8/6/86da67d9d76165d7012b06b28dc618224545cf78_2_750x557.jpeg"},{"max_width":600,"max_height":600,"width":600,"height":445,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/8/6/86da67d9d76165d7012b06b28dc618224545cf78_2_600x445.jpeg"},{"max_width":500,"max_height":500,"width":500,"height":371,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/8/6/86da67d9d76165d7012b06b28dc618224545cf78_2_500x371.jpeg"},{"max_width":400,"max_height":400,"width":400,"height":297,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/8/6/86da67d9d76165d7012b06b28dc618224545cf78_2_400x297.jpeg"},{"max_width":300,"max_height":300,"width":300,"height":222,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/8/6/86da67d9d76165d7012b06b28dc618224545cf78_2_300x222.jpeg"},{"max_width":200,"max_height":200,"width":200,"height":148,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/8/6/86da67d9d76165d7012b06b28dc618224545cf78_2_200x148.jpeg"}],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"like_count":0,"views":148,"category_id":6,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":0,"has_accepted_answer":false,"posters":[{"extras":"latest","description":"Original Poster, Most Recent Poster","user":{"id":135707,"username":"xprayag","name":"Prayag Jain","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/x/c37758/{size}.png","trust_level":0}},{"extras":null,"description":"Recent Poster","user":{"id":87436,"username":"Colin","name":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_group_id":42,"primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":3}}]}],"summarizable":false,"has_cached_summary":false,"valid_reactions":["heart","+1","crossed_fingers","clap","laughing","open_mouth","confetti_ball","hugs","heavy_plus_sign","heart_eyes","sunglasses","cursor"],"accepted_answers":[{"id":492284,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-16T04:42:14.284Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. Here’s the good news right away: on our side, everything looks fine with your account and computer. Every Recover and Reset actually completed on the backend. Only the last step fails, where the Windows app connects to the actual Grok Bot computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s happening: the app can reach our servers, but your network’s DNS can’t resolve the address the app uses to connect to the Grok Bot computer (it lives at \u003ccode\u003ecursorvm.com\u003c/code\u003e). This lookup happens on your side, so reinstalling, Reset, Recover, or a reset from our side won’t change anything. A rebuilt computer will get an address in the same zone. Please stop clicking Recover or Reset for now, each click just rebuilds the computer again without helping.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTry this on Windows:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully close Grok Bot: right-click the system tray icon (near the clock) and click Quit.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWindows Settings \u0026gt; Network \u0026amp; internet \u0026gt; select your connection (Wi-Fi or Ethernet).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNext to DNS server assignment, click Edit \u0026gt; Manual \u0026gt; turn on IPv4 \u0026gt; Preferred DNS: \u003ccode\u003e1.1.1.1\u003c/code\u003e, Alternate DNS: \u003ccode\u003e8.8.8.8\u003c/code\u003e \u0026gt; Save.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen PowerShell and run: \u003ccode\u003eipconfig /flushdns\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLaunch Grok Bot again and give it a couple of minutes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor Android on the same network: Settings \u0026gt; Network \u0026amp; internet \u0026gt; Private DNS \u0026gt; Private DNS provider hostname \u0026gt; enter \u003ccode\u003edns.google\u003c/code\u003e \u0026gt; Save, then reopen Grok Bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick way to confirm it’s DNS: try running Grok Bot on a different network, like mobile data from another carrier or a different Wi-Fi. If it connects there, then the issue is your current network’s DNS.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know how it goes after step 5. If it still won’t connect, tell me and we’ll dig deeper.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"topic_id":171796,"url":"/t/cant-reach-your-computer-reset-fails-new-user/171796/5","accepter_name":"Liyo","accepter_username":"Liyo_K"}],"has_accepted_answer":true,"can_create_shared_issue":false,"shared_issue_visible":false,"can_vote":false,"vote_count":0,"user_voted":false,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_id":null,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_url":"https://your-url.zendesk.com/agent/tickets/","details":{"can_edit":false,"notification_level":1,"participants":[{"id":137987,"username":"Liyo_K","name":"Liyo","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/liyo_k/{size}/120997_2.png","post_count":2,"primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"trust_level":1},{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","post_count":1,"primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_color":"","flair_bg_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":4}],"created_by":{"id":137987,"username":"Liyo_K","name":"Liyo","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/liyo_k/{size}/120997_2.png"},"last_poster":{"id":137987,"username":"Liyo_K","name":"Liyo","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/liyo_k/{size}/120997_2.png"}},"bookmarks":[]}